[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0312","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0312.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3635","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 5.1.1 及更早版本所采用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞，Safari 浏览器 6.0 之前版本亦受影响。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，诱导用户使用存在漏洞的浏览器访问，触发 WebKit 在处理网页内容时的内存错误，最终导致远程代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 iOS 及 Safari 的设备，攻击条件简单，无需用户认证即可实施攻击。Apple 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3635"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:37Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Apple iOS 设备升级至 6.0 或更高版本，或将 Mac OS X 上的 Safari 浏览器升级至 6.0 及以上版本。如暂时无法升级，应避免访问不受信任的网站，并在 Safari 偏好设置的安全性选项中禁用 JavaScript 执行作为临时缓解措施，直至完成系统更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3635.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3635","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3635.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3635.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3635.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3635.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2012-3635.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122a