4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3629.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3629.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3629.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3629.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2012-3629.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3629.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-36xx/CVE-2012-3629.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2012/CVE-2012-3629.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0305.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0304","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0304.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3628","title":"Apple iOS WebKit 内存破坏漏洞","description":"WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞，影响 Apple Safari 6.0 之前版本及 iOS 6.0 之前版本。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，利用 WebKit 在处理 TIFF、PNG、JPEG 图像及 ImageIO 过程中存在的内存错误，触发内存破坏，从而执行任意代码或导致应用程序崩溃。该漏洞攻击条件为网络可达，攻击者仅需诱导用户使用 Safari 浏览器访问特制网页即可完成利用，无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级为高危。Apple 已在 iOS 6.0 及 Safari 6.0 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3628"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:36Z","remediation":"将 iOS 设备升级至 6.0 或更高版本，或安装 Apple 2012 年 7 月 25 日发布的安全更新 (HT 5365)。同时将 Mac 上的 Safari 浏览器升级至 6.0 或更高版本。如暂无法升级，建议暂时禁用 Safari 的 JavaScript 功能并避免访问不可信网站，以降低被远程攻击的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3628.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3628","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3628.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3628.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3628","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-3628","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-3628","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3628.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3628.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2012-3628"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0304.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0304.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0303","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0303.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3627","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 内存破坏漏洞","description":"WebKit 引擎作为 Apple Safari 浏览器核心组件，在 6.0 之前版本中存在内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可构造恶意网站，当用户使用受影响版本的 Safari 浏览器访问该网站时，将触发 WebKit 内存处理过程中的缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 macOS 和 iOS 平台上的 Safari 浏览器，攻击者可通过诱导用户点击链接或访问恶意页面实现远程利用，最终完全控制受影响系统。Apple 已在 2012 年 7 月发布 Safari 6.0 安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3627"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:36Z","remediation":"升级到 Safari 6.0 或更高版本（随 OS X Lion v10.7.4 提供），Mac 用户可通过 Mac App Store 或软件更新自动安装；iOS 用户请升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可临时改用其他浏览器访问不可信网站，并在 Safari 偏好设置中禁用 JavaScript 执行作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3627.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3627","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3627.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3627.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3627","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-3627","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-3627","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3627.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3627.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2012-3627"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0303.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0302","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0302.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3626","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 浏览器在 6.0 版本之前所使用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送或诱导其访问精心构造的恶意网页，当用户使用受影响的 Safari 版本打开该网页时，引擎在处理网页内容过程中触发内存损坏，从而导致远程代码执行或应用程序崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有 Safari 6.0 之前的版本，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过网络远程发起攻击，成功利用后可完全控制用户系统并执行任意指令。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3626"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Safari 至 6.0 或更高版本（OS X Lion 用户需先升级至 v10.7.4），iOS 用户升级至 iOS 6.0。具体操作：通过 Mac App Store 或\"系统偏好设置\"→\"软件更新\"安装 Safari 6.0 及 OS X Lion v10.7.4 更新；iOS 设备通过\"设置\"→\"通用\"→\"软件更新\"升级至 iOS 6.0。如暂无法升级，应避免使用 Safari 访问不可信网站，并启用 Gatekeeper 限制未知来源应用，同时通过防火墙限制浏览器访问外部 untrusted 内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3626.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3626","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3626.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3626.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3626","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-3626","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-3626","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3626.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3626.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2012-3626"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0302.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0301","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0301.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3625","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple WebKit 是 Safari 及 iTunes 等产品所使用的网页渲染引擎，CVE-2012-3625 是其中存在的内存破坏漏洞，源于 WebKit 在处理网页内容时存在内存安全缺陷，可能导致堆溢出或内存地址被错误改写。该漏洞影响 Apple Safari 6.0 之前的版本以及依赖 WebKit 组件的相关产品，攻击者可远程利用此漏洞。攻击条件方面，攻击者仅需诱导用户使用受影响的浏览器访问包含恶意构造网页内容的网站，无需任何身份认证，攻击复杂度中等，但成功利用后可在目标系统上执行任意代码或导致应用程序崩溃。利用方式为攻击者精心设计恶意网页，当用户用存在漏洞的 Safari 浏览器打开该页面时，WebKit 渲染引擎在处理页面内容时触发内存破坏，从而实现远程代码执行或拒绝服务攻击。Apple 已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞，CVSS 评分为 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3625"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:36Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple Safari 升级至 6.0 或更高版本，Apple iTunes 升级至 10.6.3 或更高版本，以修复 WebKit 内存破坏漏洞。对于 Linux 发行版，请升级 webkit 包至 1.8.3-0ubuntu0.12.04.1 或更高版本。如暂时无法升级，应避免使用浏览器访问不受信任的网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-annou